Value NEIGHBOR (\S+)
Value V (\d+)
Value AS (\d+)
Value MSGRCVD (\d+)
Value MSGSENT (\d+)
Value TBLVER (\d+)
Value INQ (\d+)
Value OUTQ (\d+)
Value UP_DOWN (\S+)
Value STATE_PFX_RCD (\d+|Idle|Active|Connect|Established|OpenSent|OpenConfirm|Closing|Admin|Shut|[A-Za-z0-9-]+)
Value PFXSNT (\d+|N/A)
Value DESC (.*)

Start
  ^Neighbor\s+V\s+AS\s+MsgRcvd\s+MsgSent\s+TblVer\s+InQ\s+OutQ\s+Up/Down\s+State/PfxRcd\s+PfxSnt\s+Desc -> Data

Data
  ^${NEIGHBOR}\s+${V}\s+${AS}\s+${MSGRCVD}\s+${MSGSENT}\s+${TBLVER}\s+${INQ}\s+${OUTQ}\s+${UP_DOWN}\s+${STATE_PFX_RCD}\s+${PFXSNT}\s+${DESC}\s* -> Record
  ^\s*$$
  ^Total number of neighbors\s+\d+\s* -> Continue
  ^.* -> Continue
